==Battleground==
*The enemy base is protected by a [[Base Barrier]] until the boss is defeated.
*1 [[Metal Doge]] spawns after 6 seconds<sup>180f</sup>.
*6 [[Mooth]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 53.33~56.67 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,700f</sup>.
*4 [[Brollow]]s spawn after 21.33 seconds<sup>640f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*3 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 43.33~46.67 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,400f</sup>.
*3 [[Metal One Horn]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 56.67~60 seconds<sup>1,700f~1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Seijuro Hiko (Enemy)|Seijuro Hiko]] spawns as the boss after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Golem Sunfish]] spawns after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.
*10 [[Metal Doge]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Brollow]]s spawn after 103.33 seconds<sup>3,100f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.

